   <media:title>To Understand the Spirit of God, Start in Genesis 1</media:title>
   <media:content url="https://www.youtube.com/v/1_JMZNIWybs?version=3" type="application/x-shockwave-flash" width="640" height="390"/>
   <media:thumbnail url="https://i2.ytimg.com/vi/1_JMZNIWybs/hqdefault.jpg" width="480" height="360"/>
   <media:description>Who is God’s Spirit and how does the Spirit partner with humans to renew creation?

Watch this video and follow the Spirit of God through the story of the Bible. 

In this video, you will learn:

The role of God’s Spirit in creation
How God’s Spirit empowers humans for specific tasks
How people empowered by God’s Spirit sometimes choose not to live by God’s wisdom
How God’s Spirit rests on Jesus 
How God’s Spirit brings about a renewed creation

0:00 The Spirit in creation
0:24 The Hebrew word for “Spirit”—ruakh
2:02 The Spirit empowers Joseph and Bezalel
3:02 The Spirit empowers Samson
3:52 The Spirit and the Prophets
4:31 The Spirit and Jesus
6:13 The Spirit renewing creation though humans


